// EG2 debug area (eg2_top_verification: status/test_writing_rules.md; spec REQ_PBF_20, REQ_CDM, REQ_TL_03).
// Software in sw/device/tests/eg2_debug/, sequences in env/seq_lib/ (chip_eg2_debug_vseq_list.sv).
// Each test runs in both modes (`_cheriot`); every `_inject_fail` run must FAIL (REQ_STE_03:
// Makefile MUST_FAIL_TESTS) and is in no regression list.
